<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dell lowered due to price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dell lowered due to price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Daniel  Kunstler downgraded Dell Computer Corp to market performer from buy  due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- said in a report: &quot;Dell's valuation has gotten very rich, to the  point where the share price defies any artithmetic we might devise  to demonstrate an upside to the stock from any source other than pure  momentum.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said stock was candidate for &quot;very prompt upgrade should its valuation  get reined in.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock was off 1-1/2 at 84.</p>
</text>
